28. Bootstrap Input Sizing
1. Height → input balandligi
2. Width  → input kengligi
1. Input Height
<form>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Small input</label>
        <input class="form-control input-sm" type="text">
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Default input</label>
        <input class="form-control" type="text">
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Large input</label>
        <input class="form-control input-lg" type="text">
    </div>

</form>
2. Horizontal Formda Size
<div class="form-group form-group-lg">

    <label class="control-label col-sm-2">
        Name:
    </label>

    <div class="col-sm-10">
        <input class="form-control" type="text">
    </div>

</div>
3. Input Group Size
<div class="input-group input-group-lg">

    <span class="input-group-addon">
        $
    </span>

    <input type="text" class="form-control">

</div>
4. Input Width

Inputning kengligini Bootstrap Grid orqali boshqaramiz.
<div class="row">

    <div class="col-xs-2">
        <label>2 columns</label>
        <input class="form-control" type="text">
    </div>

    <div class="col-xs-3">
        <label>3 columns</label>
        <input class="form-control" type="text">
    </div>

    <div class="col-xs-4">
        <label>4 columns</label>
        <input class="form-control" type="text">
    </div>

</div>
5. Help Text

Input ostiga qo‘shimcha yordamchi text chiqarish:
<div class="form-group">

    <label for="password">
        Password:
    </label>

    <input type="password"
           class="form-control"
           id="password"
           placeholder="Enter password">

    <span class="help-block">
        Password kamida 8 ta belgidan iborat bo‘lishi kerak.
    </span>

</div>
//SELF
28. Bootstrap Input Sizing

→ Inputning balandligi va kengligini boshqaradi.

HEIGHT:

.input-sm → kichik input
.form-control → default
.input-lg → katta input

.form-group-sm → kichik form group
.form-group-lg → katta form group

.input-group-sm → kichik input group
.input-group-lg → katta input group

WIDTH:

.col-xs-2 → 2/12
.col-xs-3 → 3/12
.col-xs-4 → 4/12

.help-block → input ostidagi yordamchi text
